  "1": "SOURCE: the owner's SpecTrack tree for the Minolta T-10A Illumination meter (asset ATS-04959), read from a screenshot on 2026-10-26: 1 yr accuracy +/-(2 % I.V. + a fixed term) in five ranges in fc and five in lx. Built by specs/build_minolta_t10a_standard.py.",
